      "same_name_numeric_equality_or_numeric_closeness_alone": "UNMAPPABLE"
    },
    "armature_direct_boundary": "DIRECT_TRANSFERABLE requires the same diagonal generalized inertia on the same canonical joint coordinate and a verified compatible unit; for a revolute joint the expected generalized-inertia unit is kg*m^2.",
